{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDExLS0yMDE1L1N0YXJyZWQlMjBVcCUyMCUyODIwMTMlMjkv","type":"movie","name":"Starred Up","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/cy0A9BUQoL7daCBVFRyyWecoeyu.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/blHv4GsQr5zD9fP8mWph01RfzG4.jpg","description":"19-year-old Eric, arrogant and ultra-violent, is prematurely transferred to the same adult prison facility as his estranged father. As his explosive temper quickly finds him enemies in both prison authorities and fellow inmates — and his already volatile relationship with his father is pushed past breaking point — Eric is approached by a volunteer psychotherapist, who runs an anger management group for prisoners. Torn between gang politics, prison corruption, and a glimmer of something better, Eric finds himself in a fight for his own life, unsure if his own father is there to protect him or join in punishing him.","releaseInfo":"2013","genres":["Drama","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"7.1","runtime":"106 min","cast":["Jack O'Connell","Ben Mendelsohn","Rupert Friend","David Ajala","Peter Ferdinando","Gershwyn Eustache Jnr","Anthony Welsh","David Avery"],"director":["David Mackenzie"],"released":"2014-03-21T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"We're all different on the inside.","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Jack O'Connell","character":"Eric Love","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/tCzR4clrIkbkijuJBYsNoEuwRDa.jpg"},{"name":"Ben Mendelsohn","character":"Neville Love","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/uRB2ufOpCNun8G1LPsZJPnfhavb.jpg"},{"name":"Rupert Friend","character":"Oliver Baumer","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/aMOUdXtTlqtscPumbuvfcH1JB42.jpg"},{"name":"David Ajala","character":"Tyrone","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/aug1B4J5UjL1Z7iHQRF7WXdIZLk.jpg"},{"name":"Peter Ferdinando","character":"Spencer","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/guAO6rcuSCahk4v3I6Y9uqSwumj.jpg"},{"name":"Gershwyn Eustache Jnr","character":"De